+## Bounded learnability probe
+
+Run from the packet's `WORK/` directory:
+
+```bash
+python3 run_with_racket.py python3 \
+  generators/12ec29eae990/workspace/learnability_probe.py \
+  --demos 2 --max-examples 96 --survey 1000 \
+  --out ../checks/12ec29eae990/learnability.json
+```
+
+The probe independently transcribes the rule, materializes the nearby Racket
+rival that swaps rotate-CW and transpose legend tokens, searches ordinary draws
+for demonstrations the rival fits and a query it misses, and re-executes both
+programs through protected Racket. It is diagnostic only and does not alter the
+production generator.
